      "class": "rearth.oritech.init.recipes.OritechRecipe",
      "costs": [
        {
          "amount": "OritechConfig.processingMachines.pulverizerData.energyPerTick * recipe.time",
          "resource_kind": "auto_storage:station_work"
        },
        {
          "amount": "OritechConfig.processingMachines.pulverizerData.energyPerTick * recipe.time",
          "resource_kind": "neoforge_energy"
        }
      ],
      "decision": "Accept exact oritech:pulverizer holders of the shared OritechRecipe class when every ingredient is simple and non-empty, fluidInput is empty/zero, results are one or more non-empty deterministic item stacks, and time is positive. Costs use loaded pulverizer energyPerTick from OritechConfig: station work and FE each equal energyPerTick * time at base addon multipliers (1). Combine-small-dusts post-craft inventory compaction, speed/efficiency/burst/yield addons, and every other RecipeContent type that reuses OritechRecipe (grinder/assembler/foundry/atomic_forge/centrifuge/cooler/refinery/generators/deep_drill/laser/particle_collision/reactor/steam_engine) remain unsupported because Compat Kit binds one audited class to one recipe_type/station and those types need distinct fluid, generator, multiblock, or live-addon contracts.",
